      "date": "2026-05-15T11:48:09.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹55.70 (vs ₹38.75 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹55.70 (up from ₹38.75 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹144.6b (up 20% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹8.53b (up 41% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.9% (up from 5.0% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 11% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
